WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.105
JAMIE: So why does it matter today?

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.385
ALEX: Rufus, take us to the global desk.

00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:09.901
RUFUS: Because the decision to negotiate
is itself a decision. If major powers

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:13.426
RUFUS: agree to open formal talks,
that's a constraint on deployment
posture, even

00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:16.950
RUFUS: before a word of text is agreed.
If they refuse, that's also

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.474
RUFUS: a signal.

00:00:20.584 --> 00:00:26.136
ALEX: The AP says activists believe some
armed drones with autonomous strike
capability

00:00:26.136 --> 00:00:31.688
ALEX: have already been used in limited
conflict zones. Not widespread. But
some.
